<title>USA: Brightpoint agrees to buy Swedish company.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint agrees to buy Swedish company.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc on Tuesday said its Brightpoint International Ltd subsidiary agreed to acquire the business and certain assets of Telnic AB, a large Swedish distributor of wireless communications equipment.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. Telnic had 1996 sales of about $19.8 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to close by April 30.</p>
<p>Brightpoint distributes wireless communications equipment and related products.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
